@startuml Hinh_2_5_Sequence_UC_AI_01_Luyen_phat_am_Shadowing
title Hình 2.5: Biểu đồ tuần tự Luyện phát âm Shadowing qua dịch vụ âm học & AI (UC-AI-01)
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 15
skinparam titleFontStyle bold
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam padding 4
skinparam maxMessageSize 130

actor "Học viên" as Student
participant "React\n(Shadowing)" as FE
participant "AiLabController" as AiCtrl
participant "ShadowingService" as ShadowSvc
participant "Python FastAPI\n(:8000)" as PyAPI
participant "Groq Whisper\n& Gemini 2.5" as CloudAI
database "MySQL DB" as DB

Student -> FE: Đọc câu mẫu & dừng thu âm (WAV 16kHz)
FE -> AiCtrl: POST /api/v1/ai/speaking/shadowing-evaluate
AiCtrl -> ShadowSvc: evaluateShadowing(audio, answerId, sentence)

alt Tầng 1: Python Acoustic Engine (Ưu tiên)
    ShadowSvc -> PyAPI: POST /api/v1/audio/evaluate-phonetics
    PyAPI -> PyAPI: VAD + Wav2Vec2 CTC + Praat F1/F2 + GOP
    PyAPI --> ShadowSvc: HTTP 200 JSON (IPA, Formant, GOP)
else Tầng 2 & 3: Fallback Groq Whisper + Gemini 2.5 / LLaMA 3.3
    ShadowSvc -> CloudAI: Groq Whisper STT -> Transcript
    CloudAI --> ShadowSvc: Văn bản bóc băng
    ShadowSvc -> CloudAI: Gemini 2.5 Flash (fallback Groq LLaMA 3.3)
    CloudAI --> ShadowSvc: JSON điểm số, mảng màu từ & IPA
end

ShadowSvc -> CloudAI: SpeakingAiCoachingService: Groq (fallback Gemini)\ntổng hợp KPI, từ yếu & IPA -> AiCoachingAdvice
CloudAI --> ShadowSvc: AiCoachingAdvice (summary, actionTips, practiceDrill)

ShadowSvc -> DB: Lưu ai_evaluations & cập nhật student_answers
ShadowSvc -> DB: Cập nhật điểm Speaking (student_skill_profiles)
ShadowSvc --> AiCtrl: ShadowingEvaluationResponse (kèm aiCoaching)
AiCtrl --> FE: HTTP 200 OK (Kết quả chi tiết)
FE --> Student: Hiển thị Review Mode (Tô màu từ, IPA) & AiCoachingCard
@enduml
